dsh-knowledge 0.1.0-alpha.3
Windows personal knowledge-base Q&A trial — based on Sirchmunk, no embedding-model branch, verifiable provenance.

Status: trial build for authorised private trial only. Not a release, not published, and not licensed for
redistribution yet — the licence is still an undecided draft, see LICENSE-DRAFT.md (which ships as that file,
not as LICENSE, precisely so nobody mistakes a draft for the operative terms).

Contents
  lib/       built DSH plugin and browser bundle
  engine/    local knowledge service (Python 3.13) and its pinned dependency lock
  ui/        source of the browser bundle
  trial/     install / doctor / start / stop
  samples/   self-made synthetic sample library
  tools/     the AGPL patch applied to rga, and its build notes
  docs/      QUICKSTART, LIMITATIONS, VERSION-AND-DEPENDENCIES, RUNTIME-BUILD

Not included on purpose: the container runtime (AGPL-licensed modified rga plus the GPL packages igraph and
leidenalg — see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md), any credential, any session log, any development data.

Requirements: Windows 10/11 with AppContainer support, Node >= 24, DSH = 0.2.0-rc.2, Python 3.13, a model
provider, and a container runtime you place yourself.
